<mxCell id="c14" value="name=Sam is gone. Want both fields → write one blob holding both. Read-edit-put by two callers can still lose a field → Consistency and Replication." style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#fff2cc;strokeColor=#d6b656;fontSize=12;align=center;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="307" width="820" height="40" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="c15" value="Surviving a restart = the put returns after the required flush. A process that drops the key on the way down is Caching." style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#fff2cc;strokeColor=#d6b656;fontSize=12;align=center;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="357" width="820" height="36" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
